STARTING THE GAME
BUILD A CHARACTER BY:
  -Choosing A Name
  -Creating A Stand Ability
  -Creating a Stand

YOU HAVE 7 ABILITIES
  -Brawl
  -Sneak
  -Stunts
  -Wit
  -Hot
  -Tough
  -Tech
EACH OF THESE ABILITIES STARTS AT A d4
WHENEVER A PLAYER WANTS TO PREFORM AN ACTION, THEY DESCRIBE SAID ACTION TO THE GM AND THE GM TELLS THEM WHICH ABILITY TO ROLL
wWHEN A PLAYER ROLLS THE HIGHEST VALUE ON THEIR DIE, IT CRITS AND THEY MOVE UP A DIE TYPE, ROLL THE NEW DIE, AND ADD THE RESULTS TO THE CURRENT CHECK.
IF THAT NEW ROLL ALSO CRITS THEY CONTINUE TO MOVE UP DIE TYPES. 
THIS PROCESS GOES d4, d6, d8, d10, d12, d20. STOPPING AT THE d20.

WHEN A PLAYER HAS TIME TO PREPARE FOR A SKILL CHECK, THEY CAN USE A PREPARED ACTION.
INSTEAD OF ROLLING A DIE, THEY TAKE HALF THE DIE VALUE FOR THAT STAT.

TOKENS
WHENEVER A PLAYER FAILS A CHECK THEY RECIEVE A TOKEN, WHICH CAN BE SPENT ONE-TO-ONE TO INCREASE THE VALUE OF A DIE ROLL.
IF A DIE ROLL IS INCREASED TO ITS HIGHEST VALUE, IT CRITS AS IF THE HIGHEST VALUE HAD BEEN ROLLED.
IF BOTH CHARACTERS ARE IN THE SAME SCENE, PLAYERS CAN SPEND TOKENS FOR THEIR FRIENDS, BUT AT A 2X COST.

INJURY
THERE ARE 3 INJURY LEVELS
SUPERFICIAL, SEVERE, ADRENALIZED
WHEN A PLAYER FAILS A CHECK TO AVOID DAMAGE BY 5 OR MORE, THEY TAKE AN INJURY LEVEL
  SUPERFICIAL
  -Your character gets an injury that looks badass
  -No reprecussions
  SEVERE
  -Your character recieves a debilitating injury
  -A player with this injury level must soend bouble the amount of Tokens
  ADRENALIZED
  -Your character is grievously wounded
  -A player with this injury recieves 10 Tokens. The next time this character fails a check to avoid injury, they become either Incapacitated or Dead, 
  depending on the attackers intention


